      "title": "WebSocket: fix {server,client}_* parameter handling",
      "message": "WebSocket: fix {server,client}_* parameter handling\n\nSwap the order that is used by Wireshark. E.g. before this change\nWireshark uses server_no_context_takeover for client-sent packets, and\nafter for server-sent ones.\n\nFixes #20531\n",
      "author_name": "Peng-Yu Chen",
      "author_email": "pengyu@libstarrify.so",
      "authored_date": "2025-05-07T22:03:51.000+08:00",
